DP  - 2019 Jan
TI  - Robotic-assisted right medial and anterior basal segmentectomy (S7+S8).
PG  - 240-242
LID - 10.21037/jtd.2018.12.73 [doi]
AB  - Anatomical segmentectomy for medial (S7) and anterior basal segments (S8) is 
      still challenging even with substantial progress in surgical technique over these 
      years. We believe that segmentectomy could be much more comfortable with the 
      application of the da Vinci surgical system in thoracic surgery. With nearly 
      10-year experience of robotic thoracic surgery, we gradually develop a new way of 
      port placement and surgery. Here we present a step-by-step right medial and 
      anterior basal segmentectomy (S7+S8) with a high-quality video and preference 
      cards.
