TI  - New horizons from immunotherapy in malignant pleural mesothelioma.
PG  - S322-S332
LID - 10.21037/jtd.2017.12.88 [doi]
AB  - Malignant pleural mesothelioma (MPM) is an aggressive disease with a severe 
      prognosis. Medical treatment for MPM unresectable patients is still 
      unsatisfactory; therefore novel therapeutic approaches are urgently needed. 
      Immunotherapy represents a promising treatment for MPM patients. Here, we'll 
      discuss the most promising immunotherapeutic treatments currently under active 
      investigation for this still dreadful disease.
