DP  - 2017 Dec
TI  - Prevention of chronic rejection after lung transplantation.
PG  - 5472-5488
LID - 10.21037/jtd.2017.11.85 [doi]
AB  - Long-term survival after lung transplantation (LTx) is limited by chronic 
      rejection (CR). Therapeutic strategies for CR have been largely unsuccessful, 
      making prevention of CR an important and challenging therapeutic approach. In the 
      current review, we will discuss current clinical evidence regarding prevention of 
      CR after LTx.
