LID - 10.21037/jtd.2017.10.89 [doi]
AB  - We present a case of massive pulmonary embolism where the electrocardiogram (ECG) 
      demonstrated transient T-wave inversion and marked QT-prolongation. The 
      pathomechanism and clinical significance of these changes are discussed.
