TI  - Two cases of the bronchial carcinoid tumors successfully treated with the 
      parenchymal-sparing bronchoplastic resections.
PG  - E669-E673
LID - 10.21037/jtd.2017.06.141 [doi]
AB  - Carcinoid tumors account for 2% of primary lung tumors. We report two cases of 
      the relatively young patients with typical and atypical carcinoid (AC) tumors 
      that were managed successfully with a parenchymal-sparing bronchoplastic 
      procedure.
