TI  - Percutaneous paravalvular leak closure after CoreValve transcatheter aortic valve 
      implantation using an arterio-arterial loop.
PG  - E103-E108
LID - 10.21037/jtd.2017.02.41 [doi]
AB  - Significant periprosthetic aortic regurgitation after transcatheter aortic valve 
      implantation has become a major concern of this technique given its association 
      with impaired survival. We report the successful closure of such defect using a 
      vascular occlusion device with the creation of an arterio-arterial loop to gain 
      enough support to advance the delivery sheath into de the left ventricle.
