PG  - E869-E874
AB  - The invaluable role of transbronchial needle aspiration (TBNA) in the diagnosis 
      and staging of mediastinal adenopathy and lung cancer has been well established. 
      Different lymph nodes regional nomenclatures and maps had been described over the 
      years. The international association for the study of lung cancer (IASLC) and 
      Wang's maps complement each other benefiting patients with lung cancer. In this 
      article we briefly reviewed the roles of IALSC, Wang's maps and ROSE in TBNA.
