TI  - Uniportal video-assisted thoracic surgery right upper lobectomy with systemic 
      lymphadenectomy.
PG  - 2272-4
LID - 10.21037/jtd.2016.05.01 [doi]
AB  - This video demonstrated a performance of uniportal video-assisted thoracoscopic 
      surgery (VATS) right upper lobectomy with systemic lymphadenectomy. The patient 
      had a malignant mass in his right upper lobe. The operator took a posterior to 
      anterior approach to dissection the right upper lobe, the adjacent structures 
      were clearly demonstrated after the entire dissection of mediastinal lymph nodes. 
      Postoperative pathological report suggested the stage of the tumor was T1bN0M0 
      (stage IA).
