TI  - Early structural degeneration of Mitroflow aortic valve: another issue in 
      addition to the mismatch?
PG  - E270-E274
LID - 10.21037/jtd.2018.03.137 [doi]
AB  - We reported two cases of early structural valve degeneration (SVD) with Mitroflow 
      prosthesis in aortic position in patients above the age of 65 years. Microscopic 
      aspects have been analysed to investigate the intrinsic mechanism of SVD. New 
      techniques to improve the structure and the preservation of this prosthesis are 
      needed in order to reduce potential dangerous early complications.
