TI  - Devastating fast-growing lung cancer after single lung transplantation.
PG  - E1071-E1073
LID - 10.21037/jtd.2017.11.57 [doi]
AB  - Patients receiving lung transplantation are at increasing risk for the 
      development of cancer due to the administration of immunosuppressive drugs. We 
      hereby report the case of a patient with a devastating fast-growing lung cancer 
      after single lung transplantation for pulmonary fibrosis.
