TI  - Extra Corporeal Membrane Oxygenation (ECMO) review of a lifesaving technology.
PG  - E166-76
LID - 10.3978/j.issn.2072-1439.2015.07.17 [doi]
AB  - Extra Corporeal Membrane Oxygenation (ECMO) indications and usage has strikingly 
      progressed over the last 20 years; it has become essential tool in the care of 
      adults and children with severe cardiac and pulmonary dysfunction refractory to 
      conventional management. In this article we will provide a review of ECMO 
      development, clinical indications, patients' management, options and cannulations 
      techniques, complications, outcomes, and the appropriate strategy of organ 
      management while on ECMO.
