TI  - Video-assisted thoracoscopic bronchoplasty/pulmonary arterial angioplasty.
PG  - 544-52
LID - 10.21037/jtd.2016.01.59 [doi]
AB  - Thoracoscopic bronchoplasty combined with pulmonary arterial angioplasty can be 
      particularly challenging. In the past, it was often done by using a conventional 
      incision or hybrid video-assisted small incision. In recent years, anecdotal 
      articles have described the application of thoracoscopic bronchoplasty/pulmonary 
      arterial angioplasty. This chapter will describe the details associated with 
      thoracoscopic bronchoplasty/pulmonary arterial angioplasty.
