TI  - Esophageal cancer revealing a tracheal diverticulum.
PG  - E85-7
LID - 10.3978/j.issn.2072-1439.2015.04.02 [doi]
AB  - Tracheal diverticulum is a benign entity characterized by single or multiple 
      invaginations of the tracheal wall, and is rarely encountered in clinical 
      practice but frequently in postmortem examination as an incidental finding. Its 
      combination with esophageal cancer is extremely rare. In this case report, we 
      present a patient with these two lesions and analyze their correlation.
