TI  - Re-understanding anti-influenza strategy: attach equal importance to antiviral 
      and anti-inflammatory therapies.
PG  - S2248-S2259
LID - 10.21037/jtd.2018.03.169 [doi]
AB  - The direct replication of influenza virus is not the only cause of harm to human 
      health; influenza infection leading to a hyper-inflammatory immune response can 
      also result in serious conditions. So, the treatment strategy for influenza needs 
      to keep balance between antivirus and anti-inflammation. Herein, we review the 
      treatment strategies of anti-influenza drugs and traditional Chinese medicines.
