TI  - Basic statistics with Microsoft Excel: a review.
PG  - 1734-1740
LID - 10.21037/jtd.2017.05.81 [doi]
AB  - The scientific world is enriched daily with new knowledge, due to new 
      technologies and continuous discoveries. The mathematical functions explain the 
      statistical concepts particularly those of mean, median and mode along with those 
      of frequency and frequency distribution associated to histograms and graphical 
      representations, determining elaborative processes on the basis of the 
      spreadsheet operations. The aim of the study is to highlight the mathematical 
      basis of statistical models that regulate the operation of spreadsheets in 
      Microsoft Excel.
