TI  - A primary malignant melanoma of the mediastinum with gross surgical view.
PG  - E133-6
LID - 10.3978/j.issn.2072-1439.2016.01.22 [doi]
AB  - Primary malignant mediastinal melanomas are rare. Few studies have reported on 
      the chest computed tomography (CT) scan and histopathological features. We report 
      a case of a primary malignant mediastinal melanoma in a 32-year-old man and 
      provide a gross surgical view of the tumour.
