TI  - A rare case of anomalous venous drainage of the right upper lobe.
PG  - E502-4
LID - 10.3978/j.issn.2072-1439.2015.10.02 [doi]
AB  - We present an unusual case of partial anomalous venous drainage in which the vein 
      of the right upper lobe drains into the superior vena cava, together with the 
      azygos vein. This was discovered during surgery for a lung tumor of the right 
      upper lobe. We present the embryological background, functional consequences and 
      literature on this rare anatomical anomaly.
