TI  - Exponential growth of publications on carbon nanodots by Chinese authors.
PG  - E201-5
LID - 10.3978/j.issn.2072-1439.2015.06.13 [doi]
AB  - Publication statistics was retrieved on carbon nanodots (C-dots) from 2004 up 
      till 2014 using the web of Science(TM) search engine. The number of publications 
      from Chinese authors increased exponentially during this period. Till 2014 China 
      mainland authors contributed 47% of the total publications. Publications on 
      pharmacology and toxicology lagged far behind the publications on chemistry and 
      material science, indicating that research is not solidly moving toward the 
      direction of application.
